(5502558, 793669, 61788, '<td valign="top">Very artistic! I would have called it "Doubts" - she''s not throwing them yet ;) But maybe she already decided. Anyway, image provoking all these thouhts is what I value here most. Well, I like light, tonality, and compostion too :)</td>', 'Very artistic! I would have called it "Doubts" - she''s not throwing them yet ;) But maybe she already decided. Anyway, image provoking all these thouhts is what I value here most. Well, I like light, tonality, and compostion too :)', '2009-05-27 16:43:23.000000', NULL, 1);
