(5502774, 793540, 102315, '<td valign="top">The drapes in the back or very distracting to me. I think a blank wall would have better displayed your subject. I also don''t know how heavy that desk is either so I guess I''m talking out of my ass.</td>', 'The drapes in the back or very distracting to me. I think a blank wall would have better displayed your subject. I also don''t know how heavy that desk is either so I guess I''m talking out of my ass.', '2009-05-27 19:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
