(5503402, 793835, 103032, '<td valign="top">Not voting in this challenge but wanted to comment.<br/> <br/>Meets the challenge.  Technically, it''s well done conveying the message of quitting.  The focus is right on on the side of the person''s head.  Even the lighting fits to conveys the "dark" mood/subject, and draws attention to what he is about to do or is contemplating.  The person is looking down which adds to the gloom.  So this is probably the most powerful image in the challenge.  Even the thumbnail stands out for obvious reasons.  <br/> <br/>This image is the ultimate in terms of quitting, has a lot of emotional impact.  If I were voting on the criteria of the challenge, art, and technical merit, I would probably rate it above average.<br/> <br/>On a personal emotional level, I find it distasteful.  I think this might be one of those images where viewers are going to appreciate what you are conveying, or hate it.  Just my two cents.  Good luck on the voting.</td>', 'Not voting in this challenge but wanted to comment. Meets the challenge.  Technically, it''s well done conveying the message of quitting.  The focus is right on on the side of the person''s head.  Even the lighting fits to conveys the "dark" mood/subject, and draws attention to what he is about to do or is contemplating.  The person is looking down which adds to the gloom.  So this is probably the most powerful image in the challenge.  Even the thumbnail stands out for obvious reasons.   This image is the ultimate in terms of quitting, has a lot of emotional impact.  If I were voting on the criteria of the challenge, art, and technical merit, I would probably rate it above average. On a personal emotional level, I find it distasteful.  I think this might be one of those images where viewers are going to appreciate what you are conveying, or hate it.  Just my two cents.  Good luck on the voting.', '2009-05-28 09:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5503572, 793766, 86799, '<td valign="top">Poor quality.  Can''t tell what he''s quitting, too dark and muddy.</td>', 'Poor quality.  Can''t tell what he''s quitting, too dark and muddy.', '2009-05-28 11:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
