(5506871, 792487, 83313, '<td valign="top">Instant DQ! The challenge description specifically says: <i>"Depict quitting this week in your entry... <b>as long it''s not quitting DPC</b>. :)"</i> <br/> <br/>Ok, Ok, I''ll give it a good vote. Shee! some people!</td>', 'Instant DQ! The challenge description specifically says: "Depict quitting this week in your entry... as long it''s not quitting DPC. :)"  Ok, Ok, I''ll give it a good vote. Shee! some people!', '2009-05-31 18:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507025, 793896, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very original. What is that figure, really?</td>', 'Very original. What is that figure, really?', '2009-05-31 21:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507027, 793011, 83313, '<td valign="top">Took me a few moments to figure out what I was looking at. I guess this is what you see when you are drunk and stumbling down the sidewalk. An approach to the topic that is probably getting hammered in voting.</td>', 'Took me a few moments to figure out what I was looking at. I guess this is what you see when you are drunk and stumbling down the sidewalk. An approach to the topic that is probably getting hammered in voting.', '2009-05-31 21:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507028, 792851, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''d like to know how you will get him to stop. It took me many years and some expensive therapy to overcome my own shoe chewing habit.</td>', 'I''d like to know how you will get him to stop. It took me many years and some expensive therapy to overcome my own shoe chewing habit.', '2009-05-31 21:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507029, 793905, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ll take your advice and I won''t even start. DPC is enough frustration for me.</td>', 'I''ll take your advice and I won''t even start. DPC is enough frustration for me.', '2009-05-31 21:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507030, 792877, 83313, '<td valign="top">What a statement. No shortage of impact here!</td>', 'What a statement. No shortage of impact here!', '2009-05-31 21:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507032, 793904, 83313, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge in the expected way. Perhaps my only minor critique would be it needs a little bit of tilt correction. That is allowable in basic.</td>', 'Fits the challenge in the expected way. Perhaps my only minor critique would be it needs a little bit of tilt correction. That is allowable in basic.', '2009-05-31 21:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507035, 793477, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and I always like a bicycle shot. My nitpick would be the IR look. The bike frame gets a bit lost in the background.</td>', 'I like the composition and I always like a bicycle shot. My nitpick would be the IR look. The bike frame gets a bit lost in the background.', '2009-05-31 21:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507039, 793954, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not exactly an anonymous entry, with your name on the lighter. But then, some of my own entries are easily guessed as mine. <br/> <br/>Excellent sentiment expressed. I''ve never even tried cigarettes, so I have no idea how tough it is to stop. Wasn''t your quitting post the one that started this challenge topic in the first place?</td>', 'Not exactly an anonymous entry, with your name on the lighter. But then, some of my own entries are easily guessed as mine.  Excellent sentiment expressed. I''ve never even tried cigarettes, so I have no idea how tough it is to stop. Wasn''t your quitting post the one that started this challenge topic in the first place?', '2009-05-31 21:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507041, 792783, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is going over my  head. I recognize it''s about quitting smoking, but the what you did with the filters and tobacco is not making sense to me. I''ll probably say "duh!" when I find out.</td>', 'This is going over my  head. I recognize it''s about quitting smoking, but the what you did with the filters and tobacco is not making sense to me. I''ll probably say "duh!" when I find out.', '2009-05-31 21:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507042, 793730, 83313, '<td valign="top">A bottle of booze? Close up of a cigarette? Not totally sure...</td>', 'A bottle of booze? Close up of a cigarette? Not totally sure...', '2009-05-31 21:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507043, 792876, 81362, '<td valign="top">Not many people know that bladder cancer is realted to smoking. Wonder if people will be expecting lung x-rays.</td>', 'Not many people know that bladder cancer is realted to smoking. Wonder if people will be expecting lung x-rays.', '2009-05-31 21:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507044, 793952, 83313, '<td valign="top">There is a lack of sharpness and clarity to this photo and I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 36k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)</td>', 'There is a lack of sharpness and clarity to this photo and I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 36k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)', '2009-05-31 21:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507045, 793612, 81362, '<td valign="top">Extra points out of empathy with an all too familiar frustration.</td>', 'Extra points out of empathy with an all too familiar frustration.', '2009-05-31 21:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
