(5508669, 792919, 35602, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I see a lot of noise in the image, as well as lots of blur.  Composition does not say much to me either.  I wish I could find something I like about the shot, but I can''t.  Perhaps the next challenge will be better for you.  This one was kind of hard.</td>', 'Sorry, but I see a lot of noise in the image, as well as lots of blur.  Composition does not say much to me either.  I wish I could find something I like about the shot, but I can''t.  Perhaps the next challenge will be better for you.  This one was kind of hard.', '2009-06-01 17:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5508671, 793766, 35602, '<td valign="top">Could use a bit more exposure.  I see a shadow that indicates you used a flash, but it must not have been set high enough to get good detail.</td>', 'Could use a bit more exposure.  I see a shadow that indicates you used a flash, but it must not have been set high enough to get good detail.', '2009-06-01 17:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
