(5509233, 792851, 42495, '<td valign="top">Good perspective and composition; but I don''t really see "I Quit" in the photo.</td>', 'Good perspective and composition; but I don''t really see "I Quit" in the photo.', '2009-06-01 23:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5509235, 793165, 42495, '<td valign="top">Very good B&amp;W photo and I really like how the stones lead me right to your subject.  Unfortunately it DNMC, IMO.</td>', 'Very good B&W photo and I really like how the stones lead me right to your subject.  Unfortunately it DNMC, IMO.', '2009-06-01 23:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5509236, 793247, 85310, '<td valign="top">Amusing image, but how exactly does it tie in with the "I quit" challenge? <br/> <br/>You might want to move the wallet a bit further from the background to avoid the shadows currently being cast. I;m indifferent as to the inclusion of the hand/wrist---it might be stronger with the wallet by itself with modified lighting to avoid the shadows on the tabletop/backdrop.</td>', 'Amusing image, but how exactly does it tie in with the "I quit" challenge?  You might want to move the wallet a bit further from the background to avoid the shadows currently being cast. I;m indifferent as to the inclusion of the hand/wrist---it might be stronger with the wallet by itself with modified lighting to avoid the shadows on the tabletop/backdrop.', '2009-06-01 23:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5509237, 793662, 42495, '<td valign="top">Nice still life, wrong challenge unfortunately.</td>', 'Nice still life, wrong challenge unfortunately.', '2009-06-01 23:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5509242, 793134, 85310, '<td valign="top">Your image does project a suitably "depressed" tone, but I don''t necessarily see "I quit" in the image. You might be able to improve the image by shifting the camera to the right to provide more negative space for the model to look wistfully into.</td>', 'Your image does project a suitably "depressed" tone, but I don''t necessarily see "I quit" in the image. You might be able to improve the image by shifting the camera to the right to provide more negative space for the model to look wistfully into.', '2009-06-01 23:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
