(5530856, 793952, 62357, '<td valign="top">I think you have received some pretty good feedback from Yo_Spiff on this image, but I will add my comments.  In addition to the obvious technical issues due to compression etc, the composition is lacking somewhat too.  <br/> <br/>Try reading this tutorial for tips on how to prepare your image for DPC to get the optimal quality image.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">DPC tutorial for image resizing</a> <br/> <br/>It''s interesting to see you asking for comments in the scores thread, yet you show no indication that you have read them (very few marked helpful), that may put people off from giving feedback to you.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-06-16 02:28:30.</i></td>', 'I think you have received some pretty good feedback from Yo_Spiff on this image, but I will add my comments.  In addition to the obvious technical issues due to compression etc, the composition is lacking somewhat too.   Try reading this tutorial for tips on how to prepare your image for DPC to get the optimal quality image.DPC tutorial for image resizing  It''s interesting to see you asking for comments in the scores thread, yet you show no indication that you have read them (very few marked helpful), that may put people off from giving feedback to you.', '2009-06-16 03:26:23.000000', '2009-06-16 03:28:30.000000', 0),
